## Summary
The article presents photographs taken aboard a yacht documenting private meetings, during which attendees left their mobile phones outside to ensure the confidentiality of discussions. Among the guests were Marco Bucci, mayor of Genoa, and Paolo Signorini, president of the Genoa port authority.

## Key Points
- Confidential meetings took place aboard a yacht, documented by photographs
- Mobile phones were deliberately left outside the meeting area to protect the privacy of conversations
- Marco Bucci, the mayor of Genoa, was among the guests present
- Paolo Signorini, president of the port authority, also attended the meetings


